    {
      "unit_id": "u0002",
      "line_start": 3,
      "line_end": 3,
      "source_text": "## `chronos-r1` Package Interface Specification v1.0\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0003",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5,
      "source_text": "**対象モジュール**\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0004",
      "line_start": 7,
      "line_end": 7,
      "source_text": "`package.lisp`\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0005",
      "line_start": 9,
      "line_end": 9,
      "source_text": "**パッケージ名**\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0006",
      "line_start": 11,
      "line_end": 13,
      "source_text": "```lisp\nchronos-r1\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0007",
      "line_start": 17,
      "line_end": 17,
      "source_text": "# 1. 概要\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0008",
      "line_start": 19,
      "line_end": 19,
      "source_text": "本モジュールは Chron-LLM R1 Runtime の**公開インターフェース（Public ABI）**を定義する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0009",
      "line_start": 21,
      "line_end": 27,
      "source_text": "このファイル自体には実装は存在せず、\n\n* 名前空間の定義\n* 外部公開シンボル\n* モジュール境界\n\nのみを規定する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0010",
      "line_start": 29,
      "line_end": 29,
      "source_text": "実装は他ファイルへ委譲される。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0011",
      "line_start": 33,
      "line_end": 33,
      "source_text": "# 2. パッケージ定義\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0012",
      "line_start": 35,
      "line_end": 39,
      "source_text": "```lisp\n(defpackage :chronos-r1\n  (:use :cl)\n  ...)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0013",
      "line_start": 41,
      "line_end": 41,
      "source_text": "## 使用パッケージ\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0014",
      "line_start": 43,
      "line_end": 45,
      "source_text": "| Package     | 用途      |\n| ----------- | ------- |\n| Common Lisp | 標準ライブラリ |\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0015",
      "line_start": 47,
      "line_end": 47,
      "source_text": "他ライブラリへの依存は存在しない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0016",
      "line_start": 51,
      "line_end": 51,
      "source_text": "# 3. モジュール構成\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0017",
      "line_start": 53,
      "line_end": 53,
      "source_text": "公開APIは大きく5層へ分類される。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0018",
      "line_start": 55,
      "line_end": 73,
      "source_text": "```text\nDomain Model\n\n↓\n\nPure Operations\n\n↓\n\nKernel\n\n↓\n\nRuntime\n\n↓\n\nSelf Test\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0019",
      "line_start": 77,
      "line_end": 77,
      "source_text": "# 4. Domain API\n"
    },
